      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is a faithful transcription of the א תְּחִנָה פאר א שטיף מוטער (“A Tkhine for a Stepmother”) which first appeared in ש״ס תחנה חדשה (<tei:hi rend="italic">Shas Tkhine Ḥadasha</tei:hi>), a collection of tkhines published by Ben-Zion Alfes in Vilna, 1922. English translation adapted slightly from <tei:hi rend="italic">Techinas: A Voice from the Heart “As Only A Woman Can Pray”</tei:hi> by Rivka Zakutinsky (Aura Press, 1992).</tei:p>
